WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.903
-Guys, this year is the 50th
anniversary of "Sesame Street."

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.005
-Wow!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:08.707
50 years? That's crazy.
-I know.

00:00:08.707 --> 00:00:11.177
I've always wanted to visit
"Sesame Street."

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.613
-Uh, you do know
how to get there, right?

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.416
-[ Scoffs ] Sure, I do.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.851
-Okay. How?

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:20.286
How do you get to Sesame Street?

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.721
-Well, it's how the words go.

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.057
Sunny day,
sweeping the clouds away.

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.759
On my way to where
the air is sweet.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:28.595
I guess those aren't
really directions.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.930
-Oh, Elmo can tell you
how to get there!

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.065
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:34.567
♪♪

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.502
-Elmo! My goodness!

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:39.038
You can t--
You can get me there?!

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:41.407
-Yeah. Come on. Come on.
The bus is waiting! Come on!

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:42.909
-Oh, let's go. Let's go.
Let's go.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.045
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:51.850
Is this the --

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:54.287
Is this the local
or the express?

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:56.222
-Uh, it's -- it's just a bus.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:01:00.026
Okay, buckle up, everybody!
Let's go to Sesame Street!

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.193
-Okay.

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:03.529
♪ Can you tell me how to get ♪

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:05.031
-♪ How to get to Sesame Street ♪

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:07.533
-To get to Sesame Street,
you don't need a GPS.

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:10.703
You can watch on HBO
or check it out on PBS.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:13.706
I can tell you how to get there
with some help from my friends.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.442
Then you'll never have to ask
yourself that question again.

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:18.277
-Because you know.
-♪ Before we go much further ♪

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.246
♪ I just wanted to say ♪

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:22.949
♪ That this rap is brought to
you by the letters T and J ♪

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:26.185
-♪ Now just keep your eyes open,
and if you're feeling lucky ♪

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:28.020
♪ you might bump
into a pair of friends ♪

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.589
♪ Who own a rubber ducky ♪

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:32.558
♪ Just look at all the friendly
faces smile wherever we go ♪

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:35.528
-♪ Our motto is the more,
the merrier, mi amigo ♪

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:38.531
-♪ We're on the right path,
and we keep getting closer ♪

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:41.434
-♪ But you can get there quicker
with the help of Super Grover ♪

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:44.570
-♪ It's a pretty long journey,
so you might need to rest ♪

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.172
♪ You can take a power nap ♪

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:47.674
♪ Up in Big Bird's nest ♪
-Slumber party!

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.809
-♪ I'm blanking on the address
of the place I wanna be ♪

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:52.444
♪ What's the number
of the house? ♪

00:01:52.444 --> 00:01:53.846
-♪ That's 1-2-3! ♪

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:56.215
-♪ Can you tell me how to get ♪

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:57.850
♪ How to get to Sesame Street ♪

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.186
-♪ What's the matter, guys?
You look a little lost ♪

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:03.288
-♪ Elmo tries to
avoid Grouchland at
any and all costs ♪

00:02:03.288 --> 00:02:06.258
-♪ How's it going, Oscar? Well,
I guess we'll see ya later ♪

00:02:06.258 --> 00:02:09.161
-♪ Even though he's a Grouch,
he's a really good neighbor ♪

00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:10.696
-Scram!
-♪ This is great ♪

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:12.465
♪ There's so many
different people to meet ♪

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:15.668
♪ Are there any other friends
who live on Sesame Street? ♪

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:18.671
-♪ Ladies and gentlemen,
the best rapper around ♪

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:22.141
♪ Here's Tariq from The Roots
with the Sesame breakdown ♪

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:25.244
-♪ Grover, Bert and Ernie,
Zoe, Elmo, Rosita ♪

00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:28.113
♪ Gordon, Susan, Bob, Linda,
Luis, Maria ♪

00:02:28.113 --> 00:02:31.283
♪ Betty Lou, Little Jerry,
Julia, Gabi ♪

00:02:31.283 --> 00:02:34.320
♪ Snuffy, Telly, Biff,
and Sully, Abby Cadabby ♪

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.623
♪ Amazing Mumford, Prairie Dawn,
Count von Count ♪

00:02:37.623 --> 00:02:39.258
♪ Herry Monster, Baby Bear ♪

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:40.659
♪ Oscar the Grouch ♪
-[ Grumbles ]

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:43.596
-♪ Frazzle, Gladys, Don Music,
Hoots is an owl ♪

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:46.699
♪ Forgetful Jones, and Lefty
trying to sell you a vowel ♪

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:49.936
♪ Barkley, Big Bird,
Cookie Monster, and Guy Smiley ♪

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.671
♪ Natasha,
the Two-Headed Monster ♪

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:53.206
♪ Yip Yips and Slimey ♪

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:55.074
-Boy, that was a lot names!

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.143
Does Tariq need
a glass of water?

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.245
-No, I'm good. Thanks.
-Okay.

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:02.081
-♪ Now I think I get it,
what you're trying to say ♪

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:05.084
♪ It's not about directions
but the friends along the way ♪

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:07.086
-Yeah!
-Happy 50th, Sesame Street!

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:08.587
Stay gold!

00:03:08.587 --> 00:03:10.656
-♪ Actually, Mr. Fallon,
I'm only 6 years old ♪

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:12.458
Everybody!

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:16.596
-♪ Sunny days
sweeping the clouds away ♪

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:18.297
-♪ The clouds away ♪

00:03:18.297 --> 00:03:23.602
-♪ On my way to where
the air is sweet ♪

00:03:23.602 --> 00:03:25.904
♪ Can you tell me how to get ♪

00:03:25.904 --> 00:03:28.441
♪ How to get to Sesame Street ♪

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:31.377
-So that's...
-♪ How to get to Sesame Street ♪

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:32.779
-Now you know...

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:38.050
-♪ How to get to
Sesame Str-e-e-e-eet ♪

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:40.820
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:43.256
-That was really great!

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:45.458
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:48.428
♪♪

